{"schema":"yw-junior-reading-v1","extractor":"yw-junior-extract-v1","id":"junior-g7-xia-09","book":"g7-xia","title":"黄河颂","author":"光未然","kind":"lesson","pages":[35,36,37],"source":{"editionId":"cn-6b3ec445-9f7b-430c-a246-fc1903ca38b2-302ffb9346de","pdfSha256":"302ffb9346de6f76c7eca1a8a00ea67795aa5ab8f6811e8cf3033ee2c24ac1bd","textLayer":"pdf"},"prep":[{"type":"para","style":"kai tint","runs":[{"t":"◎ 1939年春，光未然创作了组诗《黄河大合唱》。冼星海谱曲后，这部作品响彻中华大地，激发了中国军民的抗日热情。如有条件，欣赏《黄河大合唱》第二乐章《黄河颂》。"}],"page":35,"indent":2.0},{"type":"para","style":"kai tint","runs":[{"t":"◎在家国存亡的关头，在抗日的烽火燃遍祖国大地的时候，诗人站在高山之巅，向黄河母亲唱出了豪迈的颂歌。想象这一情景，有感情地朗读这首诗，要读出气势。"}],"page":35,"indent":2.0}],"prepTitle":"预习","blocks":[{"type":"heading","level":1,"runs":[{"t":"5 黄河颂"},{"n":"n1"}],"page":35},{"type":"para","style":"fs","runs":[{"t":"光未然"}],"page":35,"left":3.5},{"type":"figure","page":35,"box":[0.0845,0.219,0.322,0.432],"caption":[{"t":"光未然"}]},{"type":"para","style":"fs","runs":[{"t":"（朗诵词）"}],"page":35,"indent":1.5},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"啊，朋友！"}],"page":35,"indent":2.0},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"黄河以它英雄的气魄，"}],"page":35,"indent":2.0},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"出现在亚洲的原野；"}],"page":35,"indent":2.0},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"它表现出我们民族的精神："}],"page":35,"indent":2.0,"side":[[{"t":"点出黄河是中华民族精神的象征。"}]]},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"伟大而又坚强！"}],"page":35,"indent":2.0},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"这里，"}],"page":35,"indent":2.0},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"我们向着黄河，"}],"page":35,"indent":2.0},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"唱出我们的赞歌。"}],"page":35,"indent":2.0},{"type":"para","style":"fs","runs":[{"t":"（歌词）"}],"page":36},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"我站在高山之巅，"}],"page":36},{"type":"para","style":"kai","runs":[{"t":"“望”引出对黄"}],"page":36,"left":25.0},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"望黄河滚滚，"}],"page":36},{"type":"para","style":"kai","runs":[{"t":"河形象的描写，有画"}],"page":36,"left":23.5},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"奔向东南。"}],"page":36},{"type":"para","style":"kai","runs":[{"t":"面感。"}],"page":36,"left":23.5},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"惊涛澎湃，"}],"page":36},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"掀起万丈狂澜；"}],"page":36},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"浊流宛转，"}],"page":36},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"结成九曲连环；"}],"page":36},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"从昆仑山下"}],"page":36},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"奔向黄海之边；"}],"page":36},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"把中原大地"}],"page":36},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"劈成南北两面。"}],"page":36},{"type":"para","style":"kai","runs":[{"t":"转入“ 颂”。直"}],"page":36,"left":25.5},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"啊！黄河！"}],"page":36},{"type":"para","style":"kai","runs":[{"t":"抒胸臆。"}],"page":36,"left":23.5},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"你是中华民族的摇篮！"}],"page":36},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"五千年的古国文化，"}],"page":36},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"从你这儿发源；"}],"page":36},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"多少英雄的故事，"}],"page":36},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"在你的身边扮演！"}],"page":36},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"啊！黄河！"}],"page":36},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"你是伟大坚强，"}],"page":36},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"像一个巨人"}],"page":36},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"出现在亚洲平原之上，"}],"page":36},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"用你那英雄的体魄"}],"page":36},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"筑成我们民族的屏障。"}],"page":36},{"type":"para","style":"kai","runs":[{"t":"“啊！黄河！”反"}],"page":36,"left":25.0},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"啊！黄河！"}],"page":36},{"type":"para","style":"kai","runs":[{"t":"复出现，营造出一种"}],"page":36,"left":23.5},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"你一泻万丈，"}],"page":36},{"type":"para","style":"kai","runs":[{"t":"回环往复的韵律美。"}],"page":36,"left":23.5},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"浩浩荡荡，"}],"page":36},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"向南北两岸"}],"page":36},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"伸出千万条铁的臂膀。"}],"page":36},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"我们民族的伟大精神，"}],"page":37,"left":14.0},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"将要在你的哺育下"}],"page":37,"align":"center"},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"发扬滋长！"}],"page":37,"align":"center"},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"我们祖国的英雄儿女，"}],"page":37,"left":14.0},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"将要学习你的榜样，"}],"page":37,"left":14.0},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"像你一样的伟大坚强！"}],"page":37,"left":14.0},{"type":"para","style":"kai","runs":[{"t":"结尾铿锵有力，"}],"page":37,"indent":2.0},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"像你一样的伟大坚强！"}],"page":37,"left":14.0},{"type":"para","style":"kai","runs":[{"t":"庄严豪迈！"}],"page":37}],"sections":[{"title":"思考·探究·积累","blocks":[{"type":"para","style":"kai","runs":[{"t":"一 诗人从哪些方面赞美了黄河的英雄气魄？静下心来想一想，体会抗战时期中国人民磅礴的爱国激情。"}],"page":37,"left":2.0,"indent":-2.0},{"type":"para","style":"kai","runs":[{"t":"二 诗歌既可以直接抒情，也可以间接抒情。你认为这首诗主要采取的是哪种抒情方式？你还能从自己读过的诗歌中再举出一两例吗？"}],"page":37,"left":2.0,"indent":-2.0},{"type":"para","style":"kai","runs":[{"t":"三 举办诗歌朗诵会。建议采用合唱式朗诵的形式，设计好领诵、男女生分声部朗诵、合诵等，以小组为单位认真练习，在班里展示。朗诵时，要读出节奏感和韵律感，感受诗歌回环往复的音乐美。"}],"page":37,"left":2.0,"indent":-2.0},{"type":"para","style":"kai","runs":[{"t":"四 课外阅读《黄河大合唱》，并欣赏相关音乐作品。有兴趣的同学可以合唱第七乐章《保卫黄河》。"}],"page":37,"left":2.0,"indent":-2.0}]},{"title":"读读写写","blocks":[{"type":"figure","page":37,"box":[0.0759,0.7283,0.8807,0.8094],"caption":[]}]}],"notes":[{"id":"n1","label":"1","page":35,"runs":[{"t":"选自《黄河大合唱》（解放军文艺出版社2000 2002），原名张光年，湖北光化（今老河口西年版）。组诗《黄河大合唱》共八个乐章，北）人，诗人、文学评论家。这里选取的是第二乐章。光未然（1913—"}]}]}
